From 29dde5d42652b061c0ef5fe26aa8bffad4074efc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:30:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/15] S2-4b step 4: Derby and Memory at 30 on the GBA (the
 bunting strip, clouds and wheel gondolas as stamps, the crowd without
 divisions, racer shadows; Memory's table and card backs kept per tier)

The crowd's x % 6 by folding (mg_mod6, tested), its hops from a table made once, pads and hurdles
culled before hashing; stamps are looked up by an ARM search in the room group and blitted directly.
Derby GBA drawn fps 22 -> 30 (work 36.7 -> 28.6 ms), Memory Hellfire 21.5 -> 30 (39.2 -> 24.2 ms),
Memory Sweet 29.7 -> 30 (31.6 -> 21.2 ms), Catch Hellfire holds 30 (30.8 -> 26.0 ms).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RLcGbHBa2kju7ynbaJLHT6
